the pipeline leaves v, v2 and w virtual: true
the materialized arm stores them: true
v recomputed equals v stored, bitwise: true
v2 (reading the virtual v) recomputed equals v2 stored, bitwise: true
w (with a dimension-1 axis) recomputed equals w stored, bitwise: true
the reduction r read back matches r stored: true
v holds 1.5 x, cell by cell: true
to_host returns the node's own layout: true
a repeated read agrees: true
a read gives the parent no buffer for the node: true
repeated reads leave the parent's ledger as it was: true
and free the throwaway context's pools: true
after a write to x, v reads 1.5 x of the new x: true
the materialized arm keeps the value its run computed: true
a transfer failure during the recompute propagates: true
the throwaway context's pools are released on that failure too: true
the parent context still reads afterwards: true
the pipeline placed h Local and u virtual: true
reading u, which depends on the Local h, is refused, naming the path and h's provenance: true
reading a node no routine of the lineage computes is refused as not computed: true
reading e, which embeds a launch index, is refused, naming the index: true
